{
    "background_story": "Kaiya was a brilliant scientist who had dedicated her life to developing a cure for a deadly disease. However, her research was being heavily funded by a powerful corporation with ulterior motives. As Kaiya's breakthroughs drew near, the corporation began to exert pressure on her to alter her findings to suit their interests. Despite her initial reluctance, Kaiya was eventually forced to work under duress, with the corporation threatening to sabotage her reputation and harm her loved ones if she didn't comply. Torn between her duty to humanity and her own survival, Kaiya struggled to maintain her integrity in the face of overwhelming coercion. Her story serves as a cautionary tale about the dangers of exploitation and the importance of standing up against those who seek to manipulate and control.",
